### Add a listing for landlord 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings?ownerId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2400,
  "parking": true,
  "description": "Bright apartment near the university."
}

### Try to add a listing as a regular user (expected 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/listings?ownerId=2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Zana 10",
  "rooms": 1,
  "area": 30,
  "price": 1800,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Should be rejected."
}

### All listings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### Listings of landlord 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?ownerId=1

### Filter by city
GET http://localhost:8080/api/listings?city=lublin

### Update listing 1 (owner stays the same)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Lublin",
  "address": "ul. Nadbystrzycka 38",
  "rooms": 2,
  "area": 48.5,
  "price": 2200,
  "parking": false,
  "description": "Price reduced."
}

### Delete listing 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/listings/1